    "## 3. Model\n",
    "\n",
    "| Recipe | Training |\n",
    "| --- | --- |\n",
    "| A5 Control | Original A5 with one trainable DINOv2 block and its final norm |\n",
    "| A5 Paired | Original A5 plus same-disease, different-crop patch supervision |\n",
    "| A5 Paired Staged | Same paired objective. Train the heads with the last block and norm frozen for epoch 1, then unfreeze them at the same low backbone learning rate as A5 Paired |\n",
    "\n",
    "All arms share the initial pretrained backbone, initial heads, training batch and augmentation. The first 11 blocks are frozen. Each image is scored with the sum of its crop and disease logits. Paired supervision is an auxiliary training loss on real fit images. At inference, each model processes one image.\n",
    "\n",
    "The paired loss adapts the patch matching idea from [Learning Attention as Disentangler](https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.15111). The staged schedule adapts the heads-first strategy in [Fine-Tuning can Distort Pretrained Features](https://arxiv.org/abs/2202.10054)."
   ]
